        <p>Click Start Paper to begin. You will get <b>3 Minutes</b> for 10 questions.<br>During the test, you cannot open Lesson or any other page.</p>
        <button class="btn" style="font-size:20px;padding:14px 30px" onclick="startTest()">▶ Start Paper</button>
      </div>
      <div id="timerBar">⏰ Time Left: <span id="timerText">03:00</span></div>
      <div id="quizArea">
        <form id="quizForm">
          <div class="question"><b>Q1. How are tasks stored in To-Do app?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> Array of Objects - [{ text, done }]</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> Only HTML</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> Only one string</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> Only numbers</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q2. What does showTasks() do?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> Converts array data to HTML and shows it</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> Deletes all tasks</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> Adds color</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> Saves to server</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q3. How to add a task?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> todos.push({ text: text, done: false })</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> todos.pop()</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> todos.shift()</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> todos.clear()</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q4. How to toggle done?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="a"> todos[i].done = !todos[i].done - Flip true/false</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="b"> todos[i].done = true always</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="c"> todos[i].done = false always</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="d"> todos[i].done = 0</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q5. How to delete task at index 2?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="a"> todos.splice(2, 1)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="b"> todos.pop(2)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="c"> todos.delete(2)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="d"> todos.remove(2)</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q6. What does splice(1, 1) do?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="a"> Removes 1 item at index 1</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="b"> Removes last item</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="c"> Adds 1 item</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="d"> Removes all</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q7. When do we call showTasks()?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="a"> After every change - Add, toggle, delete</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="b"> Only once on load</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="c"> Never</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="d"> Only on delete</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q8. How to save todos in LocalStorage?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="a"> localStorage.setItem("todos", JSON.stringify(todos))</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="b"> localStorage.setItem("todos", todos)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="c"> localStorage.save(todos)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="d"> localStorage.setItem(todos)</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q9. How to load todos back?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="a"> JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem("todos"))</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="b"> JSON.stringify(localStorage.getItem("todos"))</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="c"> localStorage.getItem("todos") only</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="d"> localStorage.parse("todos")</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q10. Why pass index in onclick="toggleTask(i)"?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="a"> So JS knows which task to toggle</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="b"> To add color</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="c"> No reason</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="d"> To delete all</label></div>
          <button type="button" class="btn" onclick="checkTest(false)">Submit Test - Check Result</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-next" onclick="resetTest()">Try Again</button>
        </form>
